  }
 ],
 "hast": "\n<p><strong>You can now turn any public GitHub repository into a registry.</strong></p>\n<p>Add a <code>registry.json</code> file at the root of the repository, define the items you\nwant to distribute, and users can install them directly from GitHub with the\n<code>shadcn</code> CLI.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add <username>/<repo>/<item>\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add <username>/<repo>/<item>\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add <username>/<repo>/<item>\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <username>/<repo>/<item>\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add <username>/<repo>/<item>\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">usernam</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">e</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">rep</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">o</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">ite</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">m</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">></span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>For example, to install the <code>project-conventions</code> item from the <code>acme/toolkit</code> repository:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/toolkit/project-conventions</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>GitHub registries are source registries. You do not need to run <code>shadcn build</code>,\npublish generated item JSON files or set up a registry server. The CLI reads the\nroot <code>registry.json</code>, resolves <code>include</code> entries, finds the requested item and\ninstalls the files declared by that item.</p>\n<h2 id=\"distribute-anything\">Distribute anything</h2>\n<p>Registry items are not limited to components. A GitHub registry can distribute\ncomponents, hooks, utilities, design tokens, feature kits, project conventions,\nagent instructions, testing setup, CI workflows, release workflows, templates,\ncodemods, migration kits and other project files.</p>\n<p>For example, a repository can expose a <code>project-conventions</code> item that installs\nshared docs, editor settings and agent instructions:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json&#x22;,\n  &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;acme-toolkit&#x22;,\n  &#x22;homepage&#x22;: &#x22;https://github.com/acme/toolkit&#x22;,\n  &#x22;items&#x22;: [\n    {\n      &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;project-conventions&#x22;,\n      &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:item&#x22;,\n      &#x22;files&#x22;: [\n        {\n          &#x22;path&#x22;: &#x22;AGENTS.md&#x22;,\n          &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:file&#x22;,\n          &#x22;target&#x22;: &#x22;~/AGENTS.md&#x22;\n        },\n        {\n          &#x22;path&#x22;: &#x22;.editorconfig&#x22;,\n          &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:file&#x22;,\n          &#x22;target&#x22;: &#x22;~/.editorconfig&#x22;\n        },\n        {\n          &#x22;path&#x22;: &#x22;docs/conventions.md&#x22;,\n          &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:file&#x22;,\n          &#x22;target&#x22;: &#x22;~/docs/conventions.md&#x22;\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"acme-toolkit\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"homepage\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://github.com/acme/toolkit\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"items\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"project-conventions\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"registry:item\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"files\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"path\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"AGENTS.md\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"registry:file\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"target\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"~/AGENTS.md\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        },</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"path\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\".editorconfig\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"registry:file\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"target\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"~/.editorconfig\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        },</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"path\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"docs/conventions.md\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"registry:file\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"target\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"~/docs/conventions.md\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"commands\">Commands</h2>\n<p>GitHub registry addresses work with the same commands as other registry\naddresses.</p>\n<p>List items from a GitHub registry:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest list acme/toolkit\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest list acme/toolkit\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest list acme/toolkit\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest list acme/toolkit\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest list acme/toolkit\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> list</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/toolkit</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Search items:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest search acme/toolkit --query conventions\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest search acme/toolkit --query conventions\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest search acme/toolkit --query conventions\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest search acme/toolkit --query conventions\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest search acme/toolkit --query conventions\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> search</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/toolkit</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --query</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> conventions</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>View an item:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest view acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest view acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest view acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest view acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest view acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> view</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/toolkit/project-conventions</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Install an item:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add acme/toolkit/project-conventions\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> acme/toolkit/project-conventions</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>See the <a href=\"/docs/registry/github\">GitHub Registries</a> docs for the full guide.</p>"
